<main id="authView" class="view"><div class="auth-wrap"><aside class="auth-aside"><a class="brand" href="#" onclick="showView('home')"><span class="brand-mark">P</span> potong<span style="font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:0">.studio</span></a><div><p class="mono">RUANG KERJA KREATIF / 2026</p><h1>Selangkah lagi,<br>ceritamu mulai.</h1><p>Masuk untuk mengelola pesanan, atau buat akun demo untuk mulai memilih paket edit.</p></div><span class="mono">BUAT VIDEO YANG TERASA KAMU.</span></aside><div class="auth-formside"><form class="auth-card" id="loginForm"><p class="mono">AKUN PELANGGAN</p><h2>Selamat datang.</h2><p>Masuk untuk melihat pesananmu.</p><div id="loginMsg" class="msg"></div><div class="field"><label for="loginUser">Username</label><input id="loginUser" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="contoh: rani"></div><div class="field"><label for="loginPass">Password</label><input id="loginPass" required type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Masukkan password"></div><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Masuk ke akun <span>↗</span></button><p class="switch">Belum punya akun? <a href="#" onclick="authMode('register');return false">Daftar sekarang</a></p><p class="hint">AKUN DEMO PELANGGAN: username <b>a</b> · password <b>a</b><br>ADMIN DEMO: username <b>admin</b> · password <b>admin</b></p></form><form class="auth-card" id="registerForm" style="display:none"><p class="mono">AKUN PELANGGAN</p><h2>Buat akun demo.</h2><p>Daftar supaya kamu bisa menyimpan dan melihat pesanan.</p><div id="registerMsg" class="msg"></div><div class="field"><label for="regName">Nama</label><input id="regName" required placeholder="Nama kamu"></div><div class="field"><label for="regEmail">Email</label><input id="regEmail" required type="email" placeholder="nama@email.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="regUser">Username</label><input id="regUser" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="Pilih username"></div><div class="field"><label for="regPass">Password</label><input id="regPass" required type="password" minlength="1" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Buat password"></div><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Buat akun <span>↗</span></button><p class="switch">Sudah punya akun? <a href="#" onclick="authMode('login');return false">Masuk</a></p><p class="hint">Data akun demo tersimpan di browser ini saja.</p></form></div></div></main>
